@startuml
autonumber

skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 250

actor "Público (Cliente)" as Esp
participant "Next.js Route Handler /\nReservationService" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n(Transação ACID)" as DB
participant "NotificationService\n(Resend)" as Mail
actor "Atendente (Balcão)" as Atd

Esp -> API : POST /api/portal/reservas\n(sessionId, seatIds, buyer)
activate API

API -> API : Valida antecedência (>= 60 min)\ne ordena seatIds
API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM session_seats\nWHERE id IN (...) FOR UPDATE

alt Algum assento não está AVAILABLE (e não expirado JIT)
    DB --> API : Retorna status != AVAILABLE
    API -> DB : ROLLBACK
    API --> Esp : HTTP 409 Conflict\n(Poltrona indisponível)
else Todos os assentos disponíveis
    API -> DB : INSERT INTO reservations\n(code: CD-XXXX, status: PENDING, expiresAt)
    API -> DB : UPDATE session_seats\nSET status = 'RESERVED', reservation_id = id
    API -> DB : COMMIT
    API -> Mail : sendReservationVoucher(reservationId)
    activate Mail
    Mail -> DB : UPDATE reservations\nSET email_sent_at = NOW()
    deactivate Mail
    API --> Esp : HTTP 201 Created\n(Voucher CD-XXXX)
end
deactivate API

note over Esp, Atd
  Espectador comparece à bilheteria até 60 min antes da sessão
end note

Atd -> API : POST /api/bilheteria/reservas/confirmar\n(code: CD-XXXX)
activate API

API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION +\nSELECT reservation FOR UPDATE
API -> DB : Verifica se NOW() <= expiresAt\n(Regra JIT 60 min)
API -> DB : UPDATE reservations\nSET status = 'CONFIRMED', confirmed_at = NOW()
API -> DB : UPDATE session_seats\nSET status = 'SOLD'
API -> DB : INSERT INTO tickets\n(status: 'SOLD', operator_id)
API -> DB : COMMIT
API --> Atd : HTTP 200 OK\n(Ingressos Emitidos)
deactivate API
@enduml